      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹29.94 (up from ₹28.83 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹17.6b (up 24% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹529.4m (up 4.1% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 3.0% (down from 3.6% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 10% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 29% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
